t eat, they will leave the city. Like the units, you can share all resources between cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTACK AND DEFEND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166610/extras/51e8414c4b61719a7e42bc183dd5bd15.poster.avif?t=1735937317\" width=512 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166610/extras/51e8414c4b61719a7e42bc183dd5bd15.webm?t=1735937317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166610/extras/51e8414c4b61719a7e42bc183dd5bd15.mp4?t=1735937317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to attack the cities of the enemies and conquer the castles to win the game! Prepare your army, attack strategically and defends your cities from them.</p>",
